typecheck_side_effect_function_call's constexpr evaluator converts the
callee's body eagerly (in the callee's own scope) not only when it still
contains cpp_names but also when an operator node of the parsed body carries
no type yet.  Found by dog-fooding src/util (15 of 117 files).
